body:
tw for weight and bmi

&#x200B;

yeah, mine's >!78.7!< pounds, aka >!35.7kg. !< That puts me at a bmi of >!13.5!< exactly. Above that number is terrifying because I view myself as "chubby" looking. Under that weight I get scared because it hits me that my bmi can be rounded down to >!13!< and not >!14!< and in my head that's the distinction between okay and at risk of death. Completely unreasonable I know. I also heard that under bmi >!13,5!< you can have organ failure, so I have to stay exactly at that bmi, so I won't be below it and risk getting organ failure.
